# Speaker Headshots

Speaker headshot images are stored in Azure Blob Storage.
Container: speakerheadshots
Storage Account: Configured via AZURE_STORAGE_ACCOUNT environment variable

URL pattern: https://{storage-account}.blob.core.windows.net/speakerheadshots/{filename}

Naming convention: {speakerId}.jpg (or .png, .webp)
Example: rick-claus-a1b2.jpg
